# Conservative allowlist for lower-privilege ACT runs on the VF2 runner.
#
# Match against ELF basename using shell-style globs.
# Keep this empty until a test has been validated on hardware.
#
# Examples:
# I-sample-00.elf
# U-*.elf
I-add-00.elf
I-and-00.elf
I-or-00.elf
