Zalrsc-lr.w-00.elf
Zalrsc-sc.d-00.elf
Zalrsc-sc.w-00.elf
I-add-00.elf
I-and-00.elf
I-or-00.elf
I-addi-00.elf
I-addw-00.elf
I-addiw-00.elf
I-sub-00.elf
I-xor-00.elf
